flowchart LR
  Owners[Domain services] --> PG[Separate owned PostgreSQL databases]
  S06[Topology service] --> GraphPG[Accepted graph material in PostgreSQL]
  GraphPG --> Projection[Leased verified projection]
  Projection --> Neo4j[Private Neo4j]
  Owners --> Objects[Domain scoped immutable artifacts]
  Owners --> Outbox[Local outbox]
  Outbox --> Kafka[Kafka]
  Kafka --> Inbox[Consumer local inbox and projection]
